menu "Radio node OTA"
    config OTA_SERVICE_ENABLE
        bool "Enable authenticated HTTPS application OTA"
        depends on WIFI_SERVICE_CONNECT_ENABLE && BOARD_DISPLAY_ENABLE && SPIRAM
        default n
        help
            Requires separately approved dual-slot partition migration and
            pinned rollback-enabled bootloader. Never enables NVS or eFuses.
            Private token/TLS files are embedded via CMake, not sdkconfig.
endmenu
